   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3747"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">maitreya</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'phags pa byams pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byams pa mgon po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">maitreyanātha</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P6118</idno><idno type="APIS">3747</idno><note type="comment">Future Buddha held as the author of the works that come to be designated as the "Five Jewels of Maitreya" (ID:6167).</note></person><person xml:id="person3756"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">asaṅga</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon thogs med</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">thogs myed</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P6117</idno><idno type="APIS">3756</idno></person><person xml:id="person5243"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lho brag dharma seng ge</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ལྷོ་བྲག་དྷརྨ་སེང་གེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">d+ha r+ma seng ge</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dha rma seng ge</persName><birth notBefore="1150-01-01" notAfter="1250-12-31">after 1150 before 1250</birth><death notBefore="1250-01-01" notAfter="1300-12-31">after 1250 before 1300</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">5243</idno><note type="comment">Active in ca. 1250 and likely post-dating the composition of the Rigs gter (ID:5564) - i.e., 1219 - according to [FZ6N88AU]: 405.</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3749"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ratnagotravibhāga</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rātnagotravibhāga mahāyānottaratantraśāstra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">uttaratantra</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">theg pa chen po rgyud bla ma'i bstan bcos</title><author ref="person:3747">maitreya</author><author ref="person:3756">asaṅga</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">The authorship of the work comes to be ascribed to the future Buddha Maitreya (ID:3747) in the Indian tradition from the 11th c. onward and in the Tibetan tradition. On earlier witnesses ascribing the authorship to Sāramati or Sthiramati, see [BAQ9MH4T]: 20-27. No attribution of that work to Asaṅga (ID:3756) was located in Indian sources, but the colophon of the Tibetan translation by rNgog Blo ldan shes rab ascribes the verses to Maitreya and the prose commentary to Asaṅga ([BAQ9MH4T]: 27-28).&#13;
There are six Tibetan translations, only that by rNgog Blo ldan shes rab and Sajjana is currently extant ([BAQ9MH4T]: chap. 6).</note><idno type="APIS">3749</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5242"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam pa'i chos rgyud bla ma'i 'grel</title><title xml:lang="bo">དམ་པའི་ཆོས་རྒྱུད་བླ་མའི་འགྲེལ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dam pa'i chos rgyud bla ma'i 'grel pa lho brag d+harma seng ges mdzad pa'i tig ka nyi 'od gsal ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1150-01-01" notAfter="1300-12-31">after 1150 before 1300</date><author ref="person:5243">lho brag dharma seng ge</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Commentary on the Ratnagotravibhāga (ID:3749) of unknown dating, only available as an incomplete manuscript. See [BAQ9MH4T]: 412.&#13;
The author considers many passages of the base text to be "easy" and does not appear to enter into discussion with the views of his peers.</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3749"/><idno type="APIS">5242</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5992"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i 'grel pa rin po che rigs pa'i rgyan</title><title xml:lang="bo">ཚད་མ་རྣམ་པར་ངེས་པའི་འགྲེལ་པ་རིན་པོ་ཆེ་རིགས་པའི་རྒྱན</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i 'grel pa tsin dha ra tha rin po che rigs pa'i rgyan</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i 'grel chung tshigs su bcad pa bdun brgya pa</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1150-01-01" notAfter="1300-12-31">after 1150 before 1300</date><author ref="person:5243">lho brag dharma seng ge</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Versified commentary on the Pramāṇaviniścaya (ID:3774).&#13;
This work could correspond to the "tshad ma rigs pa'i rgyan" taught by sKyi ston (ID:4221) to Dol po pa (ID:4213) ([FZ6N88AU]: 430, n. 78).</note><idno type="APIS">5992</idno></bibl></listBibl><listPlace><place xml:id="place7414"><placeName xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lho brag</placeName><placeName xml:lang="bo">ལྷོ་བྲག</placeName><location><geo>28.3893096 90.8587825</geo></location><idno type="APIS">7414</idno></place></listPlace><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel1018" name="author-of" active="#person5243" passive="#work5242" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel2280" name="author-of" active="#person5243" passive="#work5992" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel5890" name="active-at" active="#person5243" passive="#place7414" type="positive"/></listRelation></standOff><text>
